      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PERFECT MIX (8) in the money last time at this track (17.64) in a Grade 5, finishing a 6 length third. Looks suited and should go close. HEADING SOUTH (1) has a strong winning strike-rate over this track and trip with three wins and a placing from six tries. Below best last time at Dubbo (24.11) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 13 length seventh. Can feature with the right run. DOLLAR ROLEX (2) was narrowly beaten when placing two back but missed the frame latest finishing fifth (23.60) in a Grade 4/5 at The Gardens. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Expected to do much better this time. FIRE MOTTO (3) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance - solid claims again.",
